<title>FINLAND: Finnair H1 sales, profit by division.</title>
<headline>Finnair H1 sales, profit by division.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish national carrier Finnair Oy on Friday gave the following breakdown by division of its April-September net sales and operating profit.</p>
<p>Net sales (million markka):</p>
<p>				 April-Sept 96  April-Sept 95  1995/96</p>
<p> Flight operations	    3,306.1	 3,263.0	6,418.4</p>
<p> Tour operations		  416.6	   385.8	  925.4</p>
<p> Travel agencies		  136.8	   139.7	  269.9</p>
<p> Hotel operations		 120.4	   108.2	  210.8</p>
<p> Other sectors		     57.6	    51.9	  107.1</p>
<p> TOTAL			    4,037.5	 3,948.6	7,931.6</p>
<p>Operating profit/loss (million markka):</p>
<p>				 April-Sept 96  April-Sept 95  1995/96</p>
<p> Flight operations		228.4	   439.0	  597.9</p>
<p> Tour operations		   -0.3	    -0.5	    0.6</p>
<p> Travel agencies		    5.9	    16.2	   13.9</p>
<p> Hotel operations		   4.5	     6.7	    1.5</p>
<p> Other sectors			8.2	     6.3	    9.9</p>
<p> TOTAL				246.7	   467.7	  623.8</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
